sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Interface
    participant API
    participant Business Logic
    participant Database

    User->>Interface: Open places list page
    Interface->>API: Request places list
    API->>Business Logic: Validate request
    Business Logic->>Database: Query for all places
    Database-->>Business Logic: Return raw places data
    Business Logic-->>API: Return processed places list
    API-->>Interface: Show places list
    Interface-->>User: Display places
